    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Continental Introduces\nCustom Meals For\nOur Frequent Alyers\nSTATESMAN MEALS",
      "Statesman Shrimp Plate - Chilled whole\nshelled shrimp, stuffed egg and garnishes,\narranged on a crisp bed of lettuce, served with\nlemon and a tangy cocktail sauce.\nCalifornia Fresh Fruit Plate — Nature's\nfinest chilled fresh fruits, including an\nassortment of refreshing melon chunks, apple\nwedges, orange slices, plump grapes, and\npineapple fans, accompanied by a scoop of\ncreamy cottage cheese.\nCaptain's Chef Salad — Julienne of turkey\nbreast, Swiss cheese, salami and ham, served on\na bed of tossed greens, along with a tomato\nwedge and garnishes, accompanied by our salad\ndressing:\nStatesman Beef Tenderloin Plate - Thick,\nsavory slices of cold filet of beef tenderloin,\nserved medium rare on crisp romaine lettuce\nseave, action ernie erry estate and a data tor\nhorseradish sauce.\nSTATESMAN MEALS"
    ],
